Trunchbull port of ParseBench

This directory is an unofficial port of ParseBench for the Trunchbull
benchmark platform. It is not maintained by, endorsed by, or a replacement
for the upstream project.

ParseBench
  Code:    https://github.com/run-llama/ParseBench
           commit cb4c20d61c9156fdeb6fb63308349000bbd8536e (version 1.0.5)
           Copyright LlamaIndex. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0
           (LICENSE.upstream).
  Dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/llamaindex/ParseBench
           revision 2805a1d940f95a203e0ae4b88be9934f7765b3fc
           Declared license: Apache-2.0.
  Paper:   Zhang et al., "ParseBench: A Document Parsing Benchmark for AI
           Agents", arXiv:2604.08538.

grader/upstream/ contains the upstream source tree (src/, pyproject.toml,
uv.lock, README.md, LICENSE) unmodified at the commit above.
No dataset files are included. tools/prepare.sh fetches the source documents
and rule files from the pinned dataset revision and verifies them; in a
Trunchbull Repository they are protected objects stored outside Git.

The source documents were collected by the dataset
authors from public online channels and remain the property of their
respective publishers.
